{'symbol': 'NI', 'date': '2022-01-26 17:41:00', 'title': 'NISOURCE INCREASES COMMON STOCK DIVIDEND AND DECLARES PREFERRED STOCK DIVIDEND', 'text': 'MERRILLVILLE, IND., JAN. 26, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF NISOURCE INC. (NYSE: NI) TODAY DECLARED A QUARTERLY COMMON STOCK DIVIDEND PAYMENT OF 23.5 CENTS PER SHARE, PAYABLE FEBRUARY 18, 2022 TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON FEBRUARY 8, 2022.'}